cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use structyl in your work, please cite it using this metadata.'
title: structyl
abstract: >-
  An open-source, accessible, themable React component library combining
  WAI-ARIA headless primitives, a Tailwind-styled component layer, a runtime
  theming system, and a first-class DataTable.
type: software
authors:
